{"id":"9de5f7f1ae7b9565","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-finite-model-property.md","title":"Finite Model Property","display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-finite-model-property","aliases":["57-df-finite-model-property"],"display":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property","depends_on":["[[57-df-structure]]","[[57-df-theory]]","[[57-df-finite]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-finite-model-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-finite-model-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-finite-model-property — Finite Model Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Finite-Model-Property\">Finite Model Property</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> (签名, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (理论, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\">\\(\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\)</span> (公式, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"9c053a73bd2d84c4\" href=\"?note=9c053a73bd2d84c4\" title=\"57-df-theory\">57-df-theory</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak{A}\">\\(\\mathfrak{A}\\)</span> (S-结构, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FMP}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{FMP}(T)\\)</span> (有穷模型性质, 本文件定义)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Finite}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\">\\(\\mathrm{Finite}(|\\mathfrak{A}|)\\)</span> (有穷集合, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"b060448f50c005a8\" href=\"?note=b060448f50c005a8\" title=\"57-df-finite\">57-df-finite</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fmp} \\vdash \\mathrm{FMP}(T) \\coloneqq \\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(T \\models \\varphi \\to \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak{A}, S) \\land \\mathrm{Finite}(|\\mathfrak{A}|) \\land \\mathfrak{A} \\models T))\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}fmp} \\vdash \\mathrm{FMP}(T) \\coloneqq \\forall \\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S\\;(T \\models \\varphi \\to \\exists \\mathfrak{A}\\;(\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak{A}, S) \\land \\mathrm{Finite}(|\\mathfrak{A}|) \\land \\mathfrak{A} \\models T))\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>保留原谓词：对每个 T 的句子后承要求 T 有一个有限模型。由于存在逻辑有效句，该条件实际上等价于 T 有有限模型；这里没有把它改成通常针对每个可满足公式的有限模型性质。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Finite-Model-Property","text":"Finite Model Property","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-theory]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-finite","status":"resolved","id":"b060448f50c005a8","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-finite]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$S$ (签名, see [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$T \\subseteq \\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (理论, see [[57-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-theory","status":"resolved","id":"9c053a73bd2d84c4","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\varphi \\in \\mathrm{Sent}_S$ (公式, see [[57-df-theory]])","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"c136ba3960a7223a","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothe